  "description": {
   "en": "Temporary worker Ichigo's goal is to live in a townhouse! While searching for a man who could make her dream come true at her company and at a blind date, she finally finds one who lives in a tower apartment. In order to make her dream come true, she asks him to take her to his apartment, but something is not right...?",
   "ja": "派遣社員のいちごの夢は「タワマンに住むこと」。社内や合コンで夢を叶えてくれそうな男を探す中、ついにタワマン住みの男を見つける。なんとかモノにするために部屋に連れて行ってもらうけれど、なんか様子がおかしい…！？"
  },
